sx1|n|To rest on the surface of any fluid; to swim; to be buoyed up. ; To move quietly or gently on the water, as a raft; to drift along; to move or glide without effort or impulse on the surface of a fluid, or through the air.	a:1z7g,94,4~1z7g,94,4	N:vm2,45,2~vm2,45,2
